<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家リビング夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Through <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s phone, I had a rough grasp of the situation.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> would be home soon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in step with that, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE> would come too.<PG>
Now, with this many people, it gets rather troublesome.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As long as <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> die, that's enough.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't let <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> get hurt, and <STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE>, frankly, doesn't matter to me.<PG>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\注射器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Maybe I'd better use this after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if they're all women, there are four of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have to move as fast as I possibly can.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Above all, I absolutely can't let <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> get away.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\外廊下夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ドアがちゃがちゃ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So the Kogori home isn't unlocked after all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then I have no choice but to wait in my own home next door.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> is probably wary of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is there some way to make <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> believe 'I'm not there'?<PG>
All right, I'll think of it the other way around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I just have to make her think I'm not here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she spotted me somewhere far from here―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and the others are coming in a police car, and the route is more or less fixed.<PG>
Besides...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\注射器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
As long as I have 'this'.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, just in case, I put on a jacket and tucked several knives <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="ふところ">inside the front of it</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Considering what I'm about to do, moving around unarmed would be unwise.<PG>
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I set the nata and the Noh mask in front of my home, ready for the crime.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I draped the red robes over them too, anyone passing through here would be at least a little less likely to see them as suspicious objects.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, our apartment is at the far end, and people hardly ever pass by anyway.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I lay in wait in the shadows by a nearby convenience store.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Anyone heading from the police station to the apartment building would definitely pass here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All I needed was to let <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> see me here.<PG>
And right away, a police car with its light off came driving from the other direction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That had to be the one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I raised my hand as high as I could toward the police car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The police car gradually slowed down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unlike with hitchhiking, a police car would have no choice but to stop.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\パトカー夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What's the matter?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Excuse me! I saw </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">someone I know</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> riding in the back!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\後部座席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the back seat, just as I thought, were <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> looked surprised, and <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> was glaring steadily at me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"H-hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">! Do you know where </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> went!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　I lost my phone, and when I got home, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> wasn't there either...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">　Ah, honestly, and right after that incident happened...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, looking blank, and <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>, glaring at me as before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What does she mean to do, glaring like that? Is she going to say I'm the killer?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She can't, can she. If she said that, it would come out that <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>, too, was the one who did the killing in the Megasawa City case.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mifuyu</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> should be at </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">'s house. I called a little while ago, so don't worry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see... That's good, then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the others are about to―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="7">Ow!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, suddenly crying out in pain.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> had probably pinched <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>'s leg.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Thanks, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">. I'll go over to </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s house."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
And I broke into a run, 
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\路地裏.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
and hid myself just around the corner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The police car drove straight on toward the apartment building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Good. That proved I wasn't hiding in the apartment building.<PG>
Even so, that attitude of <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>'s.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have seen through it, that I killed <STYLE ID="8">Ryoji-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And she must know that I'm following <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s movements through the bug.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The exchange just now seemed to have ended as nothing but a farce.<PG>
In that case, <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> may be all the more on guard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She'll probably lock the door the moment she gets home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I should take it that the plan to make her think I'm not next door has failed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Now, there's no time to hesitate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\注射器.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I'll inject this all at once.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム1\r\n4\r\n540\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\心臓の鼓動一発.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\路地裏赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The sensation of my body flaring hot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heartbeat quickening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Strength welling up.<PG>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\鎖の大地.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
An ordinary human couldn't catch up with the police car now, even running.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An ordinary human, that is.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\路地裏.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\路地裏モーションブラー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I moved quickly, choosing back streets.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I must never run at full strength.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I go all out, my body will break down in no time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For that distance, I hold it to half my strength at most.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't collapse now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After I kill the two of them, I have to take <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> and flee straight to the Arata settlement.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I covered a 5-minute walk in under 30 seconds.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The police car was parked in front of the apartment building, and <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and the others were getting out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could hear <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> talking with the officer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション前夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\裏ルート\アイテム\パトカー夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Then, as I said earlier, we'll call for backup and patrol this area for a while and guard the Kogori residence."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wh...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With this, it would be hard to make a move, however much I used the drug.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some other plan―<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, actually, I've changed my mind. Please, take care going back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's fine. I'll lock up properly. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Besides, I've had enough of facing police officers for today. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Please, go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That won't do. <STYLE ID="9">Lieutenant Ise</STYLE> also―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Is this compulsory?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　If I tell you to go home, you still won't go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
Understood."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動車エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The officer got into the police car, and it drove off back the way it had come.<PG>
I see. If I appeared now, the Megasawa City case might come out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Still, to think she'd go this far to protect herself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I were in <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>'s position, I would put my daughter's life first, even if it came out that I was the culprit.<PG>
Well, then again, 10 years ago I did threaten her that thoroughly, using the words 'someone I can trust.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does she think that if <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> found out about the Megasawa City case, the Arata settlement would set its sights on them?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Her real intent is unclear, but things are going quite smoothly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, go on into the house first. Lock the door properly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, what are you going to do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I left something in that police car. I'll call and have them come back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Lock it properly and put the chain on too, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Okay..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE> went into the apartment building alone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is probably the signal that she's ready to <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="たいじ">face</STYLE> me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The drug only lasts so long, so I'd better show myself soon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I walked boldly up to <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"So you were here after all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I found my phone. And it turns out </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">'s on her way here."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
