{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\裏\古郡家居間美冬なし赤.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I set fire to the living room, this air, heavy as darkness, turned red.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>: none of them showed any reaction, even as the flames spread to them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I, on the other hand, writhed in the unbearable heat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The flames grew fiercer still, scorching my skin.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\爆発.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\火事.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$4080FF" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\炎.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\イラスト\呪殺編\裏\証明\証明7.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\炎.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Then, maybe because the gas had caught, there was an explosion and my vision shook.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I breathed, the scorching air burned my lungs, and the half-burned gas stole my consciousness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Having lost even the feeling of pain in my skin, I collapsed right beside <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s once-white skin charred hideously.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was the last sight of the <STYLE ID="1">daughter</STYLE> who had been at my side for 17 years.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, I'm sorry I was such a terrible mother...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I thought that with <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, I could be happy...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To have that happiness destroyed by her own mother―
{PAUSE ""}
surely she'll never forgive me.<PG>
But in my fading consciousness, I rejected the thought '<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> won't forgive me' myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter what happened, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> had needed <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The problem was that I had drawn such a negative conclusion.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If that rejection is right, will <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> forgive me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> accept me as her mother again?<PG>
<TXSPS>If so―
{PAUSE ""}
I'm glad I got to be <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s mother.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, thank you for coming to me.<PG>
And... 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm sorry, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>...
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
